      "seed": 572753368,
      "version": 382,
      "versionNonce": 1920693433,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1742797376914,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. How to leverage multiple GPUs?\n\n  * We have to compute billions of optimization steps, with large batch size\n  * The model may be too large to fit in a single GPU\n  * The input can be long. Self-attention takes O(N^2) memory.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. How to leverage multiple GPUs?\n\n  * We have to compute billions of optimization steps, with large batch size\n  * The model may be too large to fit in a single GPU\n  * The input can be long. Self-attention takes O(N^2) memory.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "created": null,
      "labelPosition": null,
      "baseFontSize": null
    },
